# Convenience wrapper (manual use / debugging) around
# pypkg/elabftwldap.apply_to_app(): write the current directory-login settings
# into eLabFTW's own configuration once the application is healthy. The
# configure-module step and the user-domain-changed event call the function
# directly. Run through runagent so the module environment and pypkg are set up.

